WEBVTT

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:04.250
Aren't you Joonsang Kang?

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:18.560
You used to come to my lectures, remember?

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.430
It's me, Jinwoo Kim.

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:22.350
Father.

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:25.690
You're here.

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:26.730
Hi, Sanghyuk.

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:25.520
You just called him "Joonsang Kang," didn't you?

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:29.190
I'm talking about what you called my Minhyung just now.

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:30.570
Yeah.

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:36.400
A student who called himself "Joonsang Kang" came to me ten years ago.

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:38.700
He asked me about you.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:39.740
About what?

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:42.570
About your relationship with Hyeonsoo.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:47.580
I heard you were good friends with the pianist Mi Hee Kang?

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:49.710
They did like each other.

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:54.880
Mi Hee did leave this place as soon as Hyeonsoo got married, after all.

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:58.300
What about you, Professor?

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.210
We were just friends.

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:02.430
I did like her, though. {line purposedly different from ep4}

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:07.770
I heard he died in a traffic accident not too long after,

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:12.650
but for some reason I kept thinking that maybe he was your son.

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:16.570
I've never even heard of the name "Joonsang" before.

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:21.860
My son is alive and well.

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.620
Just as you saw earlier.

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:27.260
Oh, I hope you didn't get the wrong impression;

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:30.870
I must have made a mistake since he looked so much like Joonsang.

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:35.460
I better head to my rehearsal.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:37.590
Sure.

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:42.470
Oh yeah, did you know that Hyeonsoo passed away?

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:57.030
You all right?

00:03:57.030 --> 00:03:58.150
Let me see.

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:01.990
You should be more careful.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.860
I'm fine; I didn't burn myself.

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:06.620
I'll clean this up, Yujin.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:07.910
Just leave it there.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.180
About the performance tomorrow,

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:15.500
I asked our parents to come and—

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.170
I thought we weren't going to be like this.

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:25.180
It took a lot out of me to tell you what I said the other day.

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:28.550
I didn't say those things on impulse.

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:29.810
So?

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:31.620
Don't act like this;

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:34.060
you being like this won't change a thing.

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:36.520
I've already made my decision.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:39.900
What if I refuse to accept your decision?

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:45.700
What if I won't give up on you?

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:01.390
We're running out of time;

00:05:01.390 --> 00:05:04.760
let's run the final checks and start dress rehearsal.

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:05.880
Please stand by.

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:28.160
Let's raise the volume on the right monitor.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:11.070
Mrs. Jung is coming tomorrow, isn't she?

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:13.780
My mother's coming too?

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:16.950
Didn't Sanghyuk tell you?

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:21.330
What were you two talking about earlier?

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:25.760
Sanghyuk shrugged it off as nothing, but I have my suspicions.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:28.630
It really wasn't anything.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:32.970
I'm very happy that you're going to become my daughter-in-law.

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:36.310
Your father and I, and...

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:43.150
and this one other person... we were all such good friends.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:47.150
I miss Hyeonsoo so much.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:51.320
Who's the "other person" you mentioned?

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:55.530
Oh, just an old friend.

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:57.830
No one worth mentioning, really.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:59.520
Oh, that man from earlier,

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.410
the one who's supposedly overseeing this resort,

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:02.990
the one that looks like Joonsang...

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.290
Do you mean Mr. Minhyung Lee?

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:08.710
Since you two are working together,

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:11.720
please tell him I'm sorry if you see him later.

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:12.870
I will.

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:16.170
If the man really looks as much like the Joonsang kid as you say,

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:17.740
then it was an honest mistake;

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.300
you shouldn't have to apologize.

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:24.480
I recognized him right away, even after ten years,

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:27.190
so I was sure he was Joonsang.

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:30.110
I've got a good intuition about these kind of things.

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:34.160
Looks like your intuition was off this time.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:36.240
I guess, but...

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:40.370
You mentioned that Joonsang visited you once,

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:43.540
what did he say back then?

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:50.760
It was such a long time ago. I don't remember.

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:03.940
Who is my father?

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:15.990
When I was Joonsang, did I not know who my father was either?

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:20.410
I never told you who he was.

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:22.000
What kind of a person was he?

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:29.460
Do you really want to know?

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:36.170
I'll drop the issue if asking about my father is making you uncomfortable.

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:37.260
I'm sorry.

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:44.310
You don't have to tell me what kind of a person he was.

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:50.150
He was someone I had loved ever since I was a little girl.

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:54.880
Would you believe me if I told you

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:58.450
that he was the only person I've ever loved in my life?

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:02.330
But he hurt me.

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:05.620
He abandoned me, and forgot about me.

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:07.790
Then he died.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:11.210
I kept on living my life, telling myself that I had forgotten him...

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.740
But I've been able to bear it all thanks to you.

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:17.280
I was able to hold all those emotions in

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:19.300
every time I looked at you and thought of you.

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:21.970
Who your father is isn't important.

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:24.810
You're my son, Minhyung.

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:27.980
Minhyung...

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:26.730
You should dress in layers since it'll be cold

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.370
during tomorrow's performance,

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:31.330
and you better stay in your seat until the end, even if it's boring, okay?

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:33.070
We understand.

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:35.270
Why don't you go worry about putting this thing together instead,

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:36.590
Producer Kim?

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:40.010
Producer Kim!

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:43.140
Why don't you two head up to the room first?

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:44.390
I'll be right up.

00:10:55.940 --> 00:10:58.070
Why don't you go up first, honey?

00:10:58.070 --> 00:11:00.400
I think I forgot my cell phone in the restaurant.

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:01.570
Sure.

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:26.810
There once was a man who went to the Kingdom of Shadows,

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:30.930
but no one there would talk to him,

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:33.940
so he was very sad and lonely.

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:36.000
That's it.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.110
Boring story, isn't it?

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.780
Who told you that story?

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:43.910
A friend of mine.

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:48.870
Do you know how to play piano, by any chance?

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:57.540
You said you were thankful to me before, didn't you?

00:11:58.130 --> 00:12:01.380
Thankful that you were able to meet a 28-year-old Joonsang because of me.

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:06.010
If you have anything you want to say to Joonsang, you should just tell me.

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:08.100
I'll listen to you in his place.

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:10.810
You can say anything you want.

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:26.140
<i>We were just friends.</i>

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.660
<i>I did like her.</i>

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:31.330
<i>But Hyeonsoo was the one Mi Hee liked,</i>

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:33.330
<i>ever since they first met.</i>

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:45.010
<i>Hey, Joonsang.</i>

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:47.720
<i>Joonsang...</i>

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:54.020
Just being able to say his name out loud like this was one of my wishes.

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:58.650
I wanted to say his name out loud every time I wanted to see him,

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:00.860
but I thought that if I called his name and didn't hear a reply

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:04.620
then it'd feel like he had really died and passed on,

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:07.360
that I'd finally realize that he's gone,

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:09.070
so I couldn't bring myself to do it.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.910
I just couldn't.

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:23.210
<i>I'm sorry, Yujin.</i>

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:28.970
<i>Even if you call for Joonsang, I can't answer for him.</i>

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:39.810
Jinsook!

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:42.770
Hey.

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:26.990
Norman Vincent Peale once said:

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:30.360
"Christmas waves a magic wand over this world,

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:34.950
and behold, everything is softer and more beautiful."

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:38.830
Allow me to introduce our specially prepared precious gift

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:42.290
to commemorate this wonderful Christmas we're spending together:

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:45.050
World-renowned pianist, Miss Mi Hee Kang!

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:51.590
Tonight, during this outdoor concert, she will be performing for all of you:

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:53.050
"The First Time".

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:50.530
Yujin.

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:16.150
I leave it all to you now, Hyeoksoo.

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:18.510
Wrap things up here for me, okay?

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:20.430
You can't tell me why again, right?

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:23.020
You're so full of secrets.

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:27.110
I don't even want to ask "why" any more.

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:30.190
I have to deal with some business that's come up at the main office.

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:34.250
Whether you have business at the main office or not,

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:37.030
you don't have to leave like this. It looks like you're running away.

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:39.370
But I <i>am</i> running away.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.290
It's for the best.

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:54.880
I have a favor to ask, Hyeoksoo.

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:31.350
How could you not even tell me anything?

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:34.160
Let's go back together.

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:35.360
I'll come with you, okay?

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:40.150
What you need now isn't me, but time.

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:43.530
So you want to break up with me then?

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:44.910
Yes.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.540
I didn't know you were such a cruel person, Minhyung.

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:51.370
How could you be so cruel?

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:53.750
Minhyung...

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:56.880
Why are you doing this to me?

00:18:57.630 --> 00:18:59.990
I'll do anything you want.

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:02.470
I'll change and become exactly the kind of woman you want me to be,

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:04.930
so please don't say we're breaking up.

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:14.480
I'm not the one, huh?

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:16.480
I'm not the one.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:19.740
I don't care if I'm not.

00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:22.990
Can't I just stay by your side? {wow I actually feel sorry for the bitch now}

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:24.910
Minhyung,

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:27.740
could you just give it up?

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:36.090
Could you just let me stay by your side,

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:39.590
so that you can come back to me any time you're tired and hurt?

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:42.430
Minhyung...

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:47.100
Minhyung!

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:49.100
Sorry.

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:50.390
No!

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:01.740
Wait, Minhyung!

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:05.110
I can't just let him go like this, Mrs. Kang.

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:06.780
Mrs. Kang!

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:15.880
Minhyung's right.

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:19.340
There's nothing we can do right now.

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:24.180
It looks like both you and Minhyung need time to think things over.

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:35.560
How did you like your classy concert out in the snow?

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:40.400
Before we bid you adieu, we'd like to take this chance to introduce

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:44.610
the man who put all of this together, Producer Sanghyuk Kim.

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:53.080
Whereas we could have held this concert anywhere else,

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:57.580
Producer Kim wouldn't allow us to use any venue but here,

00:20:57.710 --> 00:21:01.050
all because his fiancée is here today.

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:04.590
Don't you all want to meet his fiancée?

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:16.100
Come on, Yujin!

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:18.380
How about that.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:19.650
Isn't she lovely?

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:22.190
Then without further ado,

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:24.530
I'd like to hold a special unplanned interview right here, right now.

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:28.530
When do you plan on actually tying the knot, Producer Kim?

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:34.040
Oh, come on, both your parents are here today;

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:36.650
plus you're both surrounded by fervent listeners

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:38.250
who tune into our program every day.

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:40.750
Why don't you tell us?

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:44.510
We're getting married next month.

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:06.540
In that case, congratulations on getting married.

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:07.780
I hope you'll both be happy.

00:22:07.900 --> 00:22:11.120
Now, allow me to present to you two a small gift I've prepared:

00:22:18.910 --> 00:22:24.800
<i>Before I found love, before I found love with you,</i>

00:22:25.090 --> 00:22:30.840
<i>I didn't know anything about love.</i>

00:22:33.390 --> 00:22:36.030
<i>I'm happy now that I've met someone</i>

00:22:36.030 --> 00:22:39.440
<i>more important to me than myself;</i>

00:22:39.890 --> 00:22:45.190
<i>more important to me than anyone else in this world.</i>

00:22:48.030 --> 00:22:50.450
<i>No matter how much time flows by,</i>

00:22:50.450 --> 00:22:54.030
<i>even if everything in this world changes,</i>

00:22:54.280 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>this love of mine will not change; my love for you won't change.</i>

00:23:02.630 --> 00:23:05.710
<i>Being together with you, my beautiful lady...</i>

00:23:14.050 --> 00:23:16.010
How did you like the concert?

00:23:16.140 --> 00:23:18.270
I don't know enough about music to judge.

00:23:18.970 --> 00:23:23.350
All I got from it is that I think you have a wonderful job. {splendid here is not meant to reflect on the quality of his job, but the type of his job}

00:23:24.310 --> 00:23:25.650
Oh no, not at all.
